sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor St as Student
  participant UI as React portal
  participant BE as Spring Boot
  participant ZB as Camunda (Zeebe)
  participant CN as Connectors
  participant MK as Mock services
  actor Ex as Examiner
  St->>UI: Fill form, add 2 courses
  UI->>BE: POST /api/applications
  BE->>ZB: Start revaluation-application (courses = [..])
  ZB->>ZB: Parallel multi-instance: one course-revaluation per course
  ZB->>CN: Fetch published result (REST GET)
  CN->>MK: GET /results/{regNo}/{course}
  ZB->>ZB: DMN: eligible? fee?
  ZB->>CN: Create fee payment link (REST POST)
  St->>UI: Pay fee (demo)
  UI->>BE: POST /api/payments/{requestId}/simulate
  BE->>ZB: Publish message RevaluationFeePaid (key = requestId)
  ZB->>BE: Job assign-examiner
  BE-->>ZB: examiner = least busy, not first examiner
  Ex->>UI: Task inbox: claim + enter marks (blind)
  UI->>BE: POST /api/tasks/{key}/assign, /complete
  BE->>ZB: Complete user task (revaluedMarks)
  ZB->>ZB: DMN outcome + final grade
  ZB->>CN: Publish result (REST PATCH), refund (REST POST)
  ZB->>BE: Job generate-letter
  ZB->>CN: Call notify-stakeholder: Email connector
  ZB->>BE: Job save-results (after all courses)
  ZB->>CN: Sequential multi-instance emails: student, HOD, CoE
  UI->>BE: GET /api/applications/{id} (every 4 s)
  BE->>ZB: Search process instances / element instances / variables
